    {
      "section": "📋 BigPlan · AI 产品调研",
      "text": "按产品方向分析市场/技术/供应链，输出高中低三套产品规格方案。Product research, competitive analysis, market analysis, product planning.\n\n> English: AI product research: market/tech/supply-chain analysis, 3-tier product spec proposals."
    },
    {
      "section": "✨ 功能",
      "text": "详见 [SKILL.md](SKILL.md) 完整说明。"
    },
    {
      "section": "🔧 环境依赖",
      "text": "无脚本依赖，纯提示词驱动；建议配合联网搜索。"
    },
    {
      "section": "📥 安装（DeepSeek Harness / dsh）",
      "text": "本技能遵循 **Agent Skills 开放标准**（SKILL.md + YAML frontmatter），适用于 DeepSeek Harness (dsh)、OpenClaw、Claude Code 等支持 Agent Skills 的框架。\n\n```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：放入用户级共享目录（推荐）",
      "text": "mkdir -p ~/.agents\ngit clone https://github.com/kobenfang/bigplan.git ~/.agents/bigplan"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：放入项目目录",
      "text": "mkdir -p .agents\ncp -r bigplan .agents/\n```\n\ndsh 启动后即可在技能列表中找到 `bigplan`。"
    },
    {
      "section": "🔍 搜索关键词",
